                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                    <p><b>Notes:</b> In absolute, px, pt, and pc are the most common while cm, mm, and in are rarely used.
                                    <b>The VVI points are:</b> 1In->96px, 72pts->1In, 12pts->1pc. <b>Although, pixels(px) is mostly <br>
                                        commonly used absolute units, but it is not suitable for responsive website.</b></p>
                                </li>
                                <li><b>font-family:</b>arial, Serif, Time New Roman and many more.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
